Components NOT bundled
----------------------

MUMPS is NOT included in this package. The interior-point preset reaches MUMPS
at run time through the separately installed 'rmumps' package, via the
C-callables rmumps registers (see src/dmumps_shim.c, which copies no MUMPS
code and only includes rmumps's headers). 'rmumps' is licensed GPL (>= 2); no
MUMPS source is distributed here, and the package compiles only against
rmumps's C API headers. Builds without MUMPS (HiGHS-only) are supported.

BQPD, an SQP subproblem solver that Uno can optionally use, is NOT bundled,
owing to its restrictive license.
